Description: view and organise your images, videos and music
 Glimpse Media Viewer is a fast, simple viewer and organiser for your photos,
 videos and music, made to fit right into GNOME. Open any file and everything
 in its folder is ready to browse in the sidebar, with thumbnails, tags and
 cover art.
 .
 It plays videos and music in the window, saves picture tags as standard XMP
 and IPTC keywords, searches pinned folders by name, type, date and tag, and
 shows a second folder beside the first for moving and copying files.
